## Verdict: ❌ FAIL

Two critical issues prevent full spec compliance:

1. **CRIT-01**: WS router mounted at `/ws` instead of `/api/v1/ws` — breaks FS7-REQ-08 real-time update scenario.
2. **CRIT-02**: TypeScript compilation fails with TS2741 in test setup — breaks the `tsc --noEmit` and `tsc -b` build path.

Both are trivial one-line fixes. The rest of the implementation (scaffold, API client, stores, components, pages, hooks, dark theme, responsive layout, smoke tests) is fully aligned with the spec and design decisions.
